Chapter: CSharpPlug

 Plug entry. Reads IR text on stdin (the wire format emitted by
 `codex IR <source>`), parses it via the shared IRTextParser, runs
 the C# emitter, and prints the resulting C# source to stdout.

Section: Body

  opening : [Console, FileSystem] Nothing = act
   source <- read-file-raw ""
   let parsed = parse-ir-chapter source
   in let cs-text = emit-csharp-text-chapter (parsed.chapter) (parsed.type-defs)
   in print-line-raw cs-text
  end

